---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Beyond Panama Relocation" description="Beyond Panama Relocation is an information portal for expats considering Panama. No travel agency, no law firm, no sales — just honest information." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>

    <header class="mt-4 mb-12">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mb-4">About Beyond Panama</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-xl leading-relaxed">Beyond Panama is not a real estate agency. Not a law firm. Not a travel agent. We're an information portal for people who want to move to Panama and want to understand the landscape before making any decision.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10">

      <!-- Who we are -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">Who we are</h2>
        <div class="flex gap-5 items-start">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">🌿</div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate mb-1">Moisés Alvarado — Founder</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Moisés has worked in international relocation and the Panamanian real estate market for years — which means he's seen both sides of the equation: the complexity people face when moving to a new country, and the information gaps that cause costly mistakes. Beyond Panama was built to bridge that gap — not as a service business, but as a resource.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Beyond Panama exists -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">Why Beyond Panama exists</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">Moving to another country has too many moving parts. Most of the information available about Panama comes from people who have something to sell you: real estate agents earning commission, law firms charging per process, or blogs monetizing with affiliates.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed mt-4">Beyond Panama exists to be the opposite: neutral, comparative and up-to-date information, without sales pressure. The idea is that you reach a decision because you understood it — not because someone convinced you.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Who visits Beyond Panama -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">Who comes to Beyond Panama</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌴</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Retirees</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Looking for a warmer, more affordable life with quality healthcare. Beyond Panama helps them navigate the Pensionado visa, compare areas, and understand real monthly costs before they commit to anything.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Remote professionals</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Earning in USD, wanting to stretch their income in a stable, connected city. Beyond Panama covers the Digital Nomad and Friendly Nations visa routes, neighborhood breakdowns for Panama City, and the practicalities of setting up life here.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📈</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Investors</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Considering property or looking for a residency pathway tied to investment. Beyond Panama maps the Qualified Investor and Friendly Nations routes honestly — including the risks — so they can decide with full information.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- How it works -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">How it works</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">The site is free. We charge nothing to readers. If after exploring the content you want to move forward with a legal or real estate process, we discreetly connect you with qualified professionals — that's what we call a referral. Beyond Panama may receive compensation for that connection, without it changing the cost or quality of service you receive.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- What we don't do -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">What we don't do</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-mid">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't handle visa or residency applications under our brand</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't sell properties or manage our own real estate inventory</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't use fake urgency or sales superlatives</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't invent testimonials or statistics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Founder quotes -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
          <p class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-2">"Beyond Panama's idea is not visa management — it's information. And to capture leads of people genuinely interested in Panama."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">— Moisés Alvarado, founder</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
          <p class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-2">"I don't want the client to feel like Beyond Panama is selling them something."</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">— Moisés Alvarado, founder</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA to quiz -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Not sure where to start?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">The quiz takes 2 minutes and gives you a personalized starting point — no pressure, no sign-up required.</p>
      <a href="/en/quiz" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">Start the quiz →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
